KG42.register("rules-fbc53af95b94042a0bf09513",{"id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R013","paper":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation","record":{"rule_id":"v141-c-R013","mechanism_id":"v141-a-M02","name":"Energy-trade execution","process_stage":"activation","market_meaning":"The electricity shortfall must be supplied by imports from the retailer at the retail price. Scope: MMR energy-sharing region; retailer balancing at a time step. Condition: Total generation in the region is less than total demand. Surplus generation must be sold to the retailer at the export price. Scope: MMR energy-sharing region; retailer balancing at a time step. Condition: Total generation in the region is greater than total demand.","independence_rationale":"Relations governed by the approved function execution.energy_trade under the fixed relation-ownership template. Conditional branches retain their explicit scope in local constraints.","V":["execution.energy_trade"],"E":[],"omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"activation","context_text":"MMR energy-sharing region; retailer balancing at a time step.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g07-ev-07"]},"x":[],"theta":[{"parameter_id":"v141-c-R013-T001","symbol":"r_t^{retail}","meaning":"Retail price at time t, the price at which the coordinator imports electricity from the retailer to cover a generation deficit in the MMR energy-sharing region.","value":{"kind":"unspecified","number_value":null,"text_value":null},"unit":null,"indices":["t \\in T"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g07-ev-07"]},{"parameter_id":"v141-c-R013-T002","symbol":"r_t^{export}","meaning":"Export price at time t, the price at which surplus electricity is sold to the retailer under the MMR mechanism.","value":{"kind":"unspecified","number_value":null,"text_value":null},"unit":null,"indices":["t \\in T"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g07-ev-07"]},{"parameter_id":"v141-c-R013-T003","symbol":"e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}","meaning":"Generation component of the energy bid submitted by prosumer n at time t under the MMR mechanism; defined in the bidding stage and used here as an input to the energy-trade execution.","value":{"kind":"unspecified","number_value":null,"text_value":null},"unit":null,"indices":["n \\in \\mathcal{PA}","t \\in T"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g07-ev-07","v141-b-g07-ev-06"]},{"parameter_id":"v141-c-R013-T004","symbol":"e_{dem,n,t}^{bid}","meaning":"Demand component of the energy bid submitted by prosumer n at time t under the MMR mechanism; defined in the bidding stage and used here as an input to the energy-trade execution.","value":{"kind":"unspecified","number_value":null,"text_value":null},"unit":null,"indices":["n \\in \\mathcal{PA}","t \\in T"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g07-ev-07","v141-b-g07-ev-06"]}],"phi":[{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R013-C001","kind":"procedural","role":"core","statement":"The electricity shortfall must be supplied by imports from the retailer at the retail price. Scope: MMR energy-sharing region; retailer balancing at a time step. Condition: Total generation in the region is less than total demand.","expression":"\\text{If } \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{PA}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}| \u003c \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{PA}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid}, \\text{ the deficit } \\left( \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{PA}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid} - \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{PA}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}| \\right) \\text{ is imported from the retailer at price } r_t^{retail}.","formalization_origin":"source","template_id":null,"members":["execution.energy_trade"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":["v141-c-R013-T001","v141-c-R013-T003","v141-c-R013-T004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g07-ev-07"]},{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R013-C002","kind":"procedural","role":"core","statement":"Surplus generation must be sold to the retailer at the export price. Scope: MMR energy-sharing region; retailer balancing at a time step. Condition: Total generation in the region is greater than total demand.","expression":"\\text{If } \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{PA}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}| > \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{PA}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid}, \\text{ the surplus } \\left( \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{PA}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}| - \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{PA}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid} \\right) \\text{ is sold to the retailer at price } r_t^{export}.","formalization_origin":"source","template_id":null,"members":["execution.energy_trade"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":["v141-c-R013-T002","v141-c-R013-T003","v141-c-R013-T004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g07-ev-07"]}],"pi":[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g07-ev-07","location":{"location_id":"src-d485825b0d-p26-c2r4__v141-a-M02-pricing","page":26,"printed_page":"1018","section":"A.2.2","anchor_text":"(A24) the internal price in diﬀerent ways according to the relationship between total n is equal to ","equation_id":"A25-A27","figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-26.png","occurrence_role":"formula"},"source_text":"With the energy bids of all the prosumers, the coordinator calculates the internal price in different ways according to the relationship between total generation and demand in the energy sharing region. If the generation is equal to demand, the internal buying and selling price are equal, taking the average of the export and retail price:\n\np_t^{buy} = p_t^{sell} = r_t^{average} = \\frac{(r_t^{export} + r_t^{retail})}{2}, \\quad \\text{if } \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}| = \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid}.  (A25)\n\nIf the generation is less than demand, the deficit generation has to be supplied by the power imported from the retailer at the retail price, and the cost of this import should be covered. Therefore, in this situation, the internal selling price keeps the same as that in Formula (A25), but the buying price is modified:\n\n\\begin{cases} p_t^{buy} = \\frac{\\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}| \\cdot r_t^{average} + \\left( \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid} - \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}| \\right) \\cdot r_t^{retail}}{\\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid}} \\\\ p_t^{sell} = r_t^{average} \\end{cases} \\quad \\text{if } \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}| \u003c \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid}.  (A26)\n\nSimilarly, if the generation is higher than demand, the surplus generation needs to be sold to the retailer at the export price, and this part of income needs to be distributed among all the prosumers who provide electricity by generation or EV discharging. The internal price is calculated as follows:\n\n\\begin{cases} p_t^{buy} = r_t^{average} \\\\ p_t^{sell} = \\frac{\\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid} \\cdot r_t^{average} + \\left( \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}| - \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid} \\right) \\cdot r_t^{export}}{\\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}|} \\end{cases} \\quad \\text{if } \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} |e_{gen,n,t}^{bid}| > \\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}} e_{dem,n,t}^{bid}.  (A27)\n\nFormulas (A25)-(A27) compose the pricing model in the coordinator agent under mid-market rate mechanism."},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g07-ev-06","location":{"location_id":"src-d485825b0d-p26-c2r4__v141-a-M02-bidding","page":26,"printed_page":"1018","section":"A.2.2","anchor_text":"(A24) the internal price in diﬀerent ways according to the relationship between total n is equal to ","equation_id":"A24","figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-26.png","occurrence_role":"formula"},"source_text":"The MMR mechanism requires each prosumer to provide the energy bid that contains both generation and demand at each time step separately rather than an overall net demand as that in the SDR mechanism:\n\ne^{bid} = e_{gen}^{bid} \\cup e_{dem}^{bid}\n= \\{ e_{gen,t}^{bid} \\mid e_{gen,t}^{bid} = (x_t^{dis*} \\eta^{dis}) - P_{PV,t}, t \\in T \\}\n\\cup \\{ e_{dem,t}^{bid} \\mid e_{dem,t}^{bid} = \\left( \\sum_{\\delta \\in \\mathcal{A}_f} x_{\\delta,t}^* \\right) + \\left( \\frac{x_t^{ch*}}{\\eta^{ch}} + P_t^{must-run} \\right), t \\in T \\}  (A24)"}],"field_notes":{"empty_E_reason":"C explicitly supplied only source-backed unary facts for this function; other graph gaps remain reviewable.","empty_x_reason":"No explicit decision variable symbol for the energy-trade execution is defined in the supplied evidence for this rule. The coordinator's energy exchange quantity is implicit in the deficit/surplus quantities, but no symbolic variable for it appears in v141-b-g07-ev-07. The frozen graph's V contains only execution.energy_trade, and C.1 did not create typed variable objects for this rule.","empty_theta_reason":null},"evidence_basis":"explicit","implementation_status":"unimplemented","status":"needs_review","lead_ids":["v141-a-M02-pricing"],"extras":{"decision_anchor":"execution.energy_trade","graph_fact_supports":[[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g07-ev-07","quote":"If the generation is less than demand, the deficit generation has to be supplied by the power imported from the retailer at the retail price"}],[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g07-ev-07","quote":"Similarly, if the generation is higher than demand, the surplus generation needs to be sold to the retailer at the export price"}]],"C2_formalization":{"graph_sha256":"6af73215be4a4ca1be68cc19aaf99597d2c6b7083a9728b8d61784d07423c837","applicability":"formalized","reason":"The rule's two procedural constraints are supported by the MMR pricing-model conditions in v141-b-g07-ev-07 (Formulas A26 and A27), which state that a generation deficit is imported from the retailer at the retail price and a surplus is sold to the retailer at the export price. The deficit and surplus quantities are directly expressed by the summed bid terms in those formulas. No additional graph nodes are required; the needed bid and price symbols are declared as parameters of this rule. B evidence remains unreviewed under the experimental policy.","bindings":[{"object_id":"v141-c-R013-T001","node_ids":["execution.energy_trade"],"edge_ids":[],"rationale":"Retail price is an exogenous input to the energy-trade execution; when total generation is less than total demand, the deficit is imported at this price by execution.energy_trade under MMR."},{"object_id":"v141-c-R013-T002","node_ids":["execution.energy_trade"],"edge_ids":[],"rationale":"Export price is an exogenous input to the energy-trade execution; when total generation exceeds total demand, the surplus is sold at this price by execution.energy_trade under MMR."},{"object_id":"v141-c-R013-T003","node_ids":["execution.energy_trade"],"edge_ids":[],"rationale":"Generation bid component is an input quantity to the energy-trade execution condition and deficit/surplus calculation under MMR."},{"object_id":"v141-c-R013-T004","node_ids":["execution.energy_trade"],"edge_ids":[],"rationale":"Demand bid component is an input quantity to the energy-trade execution condition and deficit/surplus calculation under MMR."},{"object_id":"v141-c-R013-C001","node_ids":["execution.energy_trade"],"edge_ids":[],"rationale":"This constraint specifies the conditional import of the deficit from the retailer, an action of execution.energy_trade under MMR."},{"object_id":"v141-c-R013-C002","node_ids":["execution.energy_trade"],"edge_ids":[],"rationale":"This constraint specifies the conditional sale of the surplus to the retailer, an action of execution.energy_trade under MMR."}],"revision_requests":[]}},"quarantined_references":[]}});
